---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Main from "@/components/Main.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import config from "@/config";
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${config.site.title}`}
  description="Current privacy practices for The Noise Filter."
>
  <Header />
  <Main pageTitle="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Trust" class="app-prose">
    <p>
      The Noise Filter is an independently published static site. We respect
      reader privacy and operate with minimal technical data collection.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Collection and Tracking</h2>
    <p>
      The Noise Filter does not use tracking cookies, browser fingerprinting,
      or cross-site advertising trackers. We do not maintain user accounts,
      require logins, run comments sections, or operate newsletter marketing forms.
    </p>

    <h2>Hosting and Technical Infrastructure</h2>
    <p>
      The site is delivered as static files hosted on GitHub Pages. As part of
      standard web server operations, hosting infrastructure may record basic
      technical connection metadata (such as IP addresses, user agent strings,
      and requested resource paths) necessary to deliver content securely and
      prevent malicious abuse, subject to GitHub's Privacy Statement.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links and External Content</h2>
    <p>
      Our articles include source citations and links to external websites,
      official product documentation, and regulatory dockets. We do not control
      the privacy practices or cookie policies of third-party websites. Readers
      visiting external links should consult the privacy policies of those
      respective platforms.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and Monetization</h2>
    <p>
      At the time of this publication, The Noise Filter contains no display
      advertisements, paid commercial sponsorships, or affiliate tracking links.
      If monetization features are introduced in the future, this policy will
      be updated in advance with clear disclosures.
    </p>
  </Main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
